      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Duvnjak et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Brucella spp. that cause marine brucellosis are becoming more important, as the disease appears to be more widespread than originally thought. Here, we report a whole and annotated genome sequence of Brucella ceti CRO350, a sequence type 27 strain isolated from a bottlenose dolphin carcass found in the Croatian part of the northern Adriatic Sea."
